{"title":"Notes on living","markdown":{"yaml":{"pagetitle":"Notes on Living | Vinay Varma","description":"Thoughts, questions, and observations on living with greater attention.","toc":false,"page-layout":"full"},"headingText":"Notes on living","containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n::: {.journal-page}\n\n::: {.journal-hero}\n::: {.journal-kicker}\nThoughts & musings on life\n:::\n\n\nThese are not finished ideas. They are observations gathered while trying to understand what makes a life feel vivid, honest, and fully lived.\n\nSome have held up. Some will not. I keep both.\n:::\n\n::: {.journal-stream aria-label=\"Essays and notes\"}\n\n<a class=\"journal-entry\" href=\"posts/2024-11-03-Bucket-list/\" aria-label=\"Read Things I want to do\">\n  <time class=\"journal-date\" datetime=\"2024-11-03\"><span>03</span><span>Nov 2024</span></time>\n  <span class=\"journal-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n  <span class=\"journal-entry-copy\">\n    <span class=\"journal-number\">Note 06</span>\n    <strong>Things I want to do</strong>\n    <span>A list of experiences I want to meet directly, not merely understand from a distance.</span>\n    <span class=\"journal-read\">Read note <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></span>\n  </span>\n</a>\n\n<a class=\"journal-entry\" href=\"posts/2023-04-25-Psychedelic-experience/\" aria-label=\"Read Psychedelic experience\">\n  <time class=\"journal-date\" datetime=\"2023-04-25\"><span>25</span><span>Apr 2023</span></time>\n  <span class=\"journal-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n  <span class=\"journal-entry-copy\">\n    <span class=\"journal-number\">Note 05</span>\n    <strong>Psychedelic experience</strong>\n    <span>A brief record of certainty, altered perception, and a mind struggling to contain the experience passing through it.</span>\n    <span class=\"journal-read\">Read note <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></span>\n  </span>\n</a>\n\n<a class=\"journal-entry\" href=\"posts/2020-09-08-Accept-your-drives/\" aria-label=\"Read Accept all your drives\">\n  <time class=\"journal-date\" datetime=\"2020-09-08\"><span>08</span><span>Sep 2020</span></time>\n  <span class=\"journal-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n  <span class=\"journal-entry-copy\">\n    <span class=\"journal-number\">Note 04</span>\n    <strong>Accept all your drives</strong>\n    <span>On the friction between human nature and cultural imagination, and the cost of refusing to see ourselves clearly.</span>\n    <span class=\"journal-read\">Read note <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></span>\n  </span>\n</a>\n\n<a class=\"journal-entry\" href=\"posts/2020-05-05-On-Building-Things/\" aria-label=\"Read Thoughts on building things\">\n  <time class=\"journal-date\" datetime=\"2020-05-05\"><span>05</span><span>May 2020</span></time>\n  <span class=\"journal-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n  <span class=\"journal-entry-copy\">\n    <span class=\"journal-number\">Note 03</span>\n    <strong>Thoughts on building things</strong>\n    <span>Notes on ambition, attention, discipline, luck, and the daily practice of making difficult things real.</span>\n    <span class=\"journal-read\">Read note <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></span>\n  </span>\n</a>\n\n<a class=\"journal-entry\" href=\"posts/2020-05-05-Collected-Thoughts/\" aria-label=\"Read Think on these\">\n  <time class=\"journal-date\" datetime=\"2020-05-05\"><span>05</span><span>May 2020</span></time>\n  <span class=\"journal-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n  <span class=\"journal-entry-copy\">\n    <span class=\"journal-number\">Note 02</span>\n    <strong>Think on these</strong>\n    <span>Short observations on intention, desire, education, discipline, love, and the strange work of being aware.</span>\n    <span class=\"journal-read\">Read note <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></span>\n  </span>\n</a>\n\n<a class=\"journal-entry\" href=\"posts/2019-08-19-Action/\" aria-label=\"Read Introspection\">\n  <time class=\"journal-date\" datetime=\"2019-08-19\"><span>19</span><span>Aug 2019</span></time>\n  <span class=\"journal-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n  <span class=\"journal-entry-copy\">\n    <span class=\"journal-number\">Note 01</span>\n    <strong>Introspection</strong>\n    <span>Fragments on action, mental states, impermanence, dissatisfaction, love, and the inescapable fact of now.</span>\n    <span class=\"journal-read\">Read note <span aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></span>\n  </span>\n</a>\n\n:::\n\n::: {.journal-end}\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\">✦</span>\n\nThe thread continues.\n:::\n\n:::\n\n```{=html}\n<script>\ndocument.documentElement.classList.add(\"journal-enhanced\");\nconst entries = document.querySelectorAll(\".journal-entry\");\nif (\"IntersectionObserver\" in window) {\n  const observer = new IntersectionObserver((items) => {\n    items.forEach((item) => {\n      if (item.isIntersecting) {\n        item.target.classList.add(\"is-visible\");\n        observer.unobserve(item.target);\n      }\n    });\n  }, { threshold: 0.14, rootMargin: \"0px 0px -8%\" });\n  entries.forEach((entry) => observer.observe(entry));\n} else {\n  entries.forEach((entry) => entry.classList.add(\"is-visible\"));\n}\n</script>\n```\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n::: {.journal-page}\n\n::: {.journal-hero}\n::: {.journal-kicker}\nThoughts & musings on life\n:::\n\n# Notes on living\n\nThese are not finished ideas. They are observations gathered while trying to understand what makes a life feel vivid, honest, and fully lived.\n\nSome have held up. Some will not. I keep both.\n:::\n\n::: {.journal-stream aria-label=\"Essays and notes\"}\n\n<a class=\"journal-entry\" href=\"posts/2024-11-03-Bucket-list/\" aria-label=\"Read Things I want to do\">\n  <time class=\"journal-date\" datetime=\"2024-11-03\"><span>03</span><span>Nov 2024</span></time>\n  <span class=\"journal-marker\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n  <span class=\"journal-entry-copy\">\n    <span class=\"journal-number\">Note 06</span>\n    <strong>Things